    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse interactive objects and obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleek, minimalist art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive difficulty with varied challenges<strong></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rotate mirrors to enlarge light beams:</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/4ccb6eac0840a085c43f8abeb6d768ef.poster.avif?t=1727785374\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/4ccb6eac0840a085c43f8abeb6d768ef.webm?t=1727785374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/4ccb6eac0840a085c43f8abeb6d768ef.mp4?t=1727785374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid obstacles affected by light:</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/bb2f0edb762d18cd3b08a13f8ae775da.poster.avif?t=1727785374\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/bb2f0edb762d18cd3b08a13f8ae775da.webm?t=1727785374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/bb2f0edb762d18cd3b08a13f8ae775da.mp4?t=1727785374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are different smoke types. Good ones. Bad ones: </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/d809867fee47610c69710659f11a0355.poster.avif?t=1727785374\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/d809867fee47610c69710659f11a0355.webm?t=1727785374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/d809867fee47610c69710659f11a0355.mp4?t=1727785374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> <br>Press buttons. Rotate double walls:</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/538a78dc65a0170ba4e03c8c31fce06e.poster.avif?t=1727785374\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/538a78dc65a0170ba4e03c8c31fce06e.webm?t=1727785374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3206180/extras/538a78dc65a0170ba4e03c8c31fce06e.mp4?t=1727785374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
